        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brains. Battles. Breakthroughs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission: Outthink, Outsolve, and Outsmart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where your sharpest weapon isn’t a sword—it’s your mind. Travel through mysterious realms, crack ancient codes, outwit quirky rivals, and face off in real-time battles where strategy matters more than speed. Every quest is packed with hidden secrets, twisted puzzles, and real risks on this enchanted island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll collect rare items, unlock new areas, and level up your skills—not just in the game, but in real life. Because here’s the twist: to win, you’ll need to use the same tools real-world problem-solvers rely on—like analyzing data, spotting patterns, and thinking critically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed especially for middle and high schoolers, this game-based learning adventure turns statistics into a superpower. No boring lectures. No pop quizzes. Just immersive storylines, brain-boosting gameplay, and battles that demand both logic and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing to learn or just love a smart challenge, this game delivers strategy, storytelling, and action—all in one unforgettable quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat meets critical thinking</strong> in fast-paced, real-time encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-based missions</strong> filled with puzzles, traps, and decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse worlds</strong> with hidden areas, collectible gear, and side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-world math and data skills</strong> seamlessly integrated into gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements, upgrades, and unlockable story paths</strong> that reward exploration and problem-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual reality components (coming soon!)</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brains. Battles. Breakthroughs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission: Outthink, Outsolve, and Outsmart.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a world where your sharpest weapon isn’t a sword—it’s your mind. Travel through mysterious realms, crack ancient codes, outwit quirky rivals, and face off in real-time battles where strategy matters more than speed. Every quest is packed with hidden secrets, twisted puzzles, and real risks on this enchanted island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll collect rare items, unlock new areas, and level up your skills—not just in the game, but in real life. Because here’s the twist: to win, you’ll need to use the same tools real-world problem-solvers rely on—like analyzing data, spotting patterns, and thinking critically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed especially for middle and high schoolers, this game-based learning adventure turns statistics into a superpower. No boring lectures. No pop quizzes. Just immersive storylines, brain-boosting gameplay, and battles that demand both logic and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're playing to learn or just love a smart challenge, this game delivers strategy, storytelling, and action—all in one unforgettable quest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat meets critical thinking</strong> in fast-paced, real-time encounters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-based missions</strong> filled with puzzles, traps, and decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse worlds</strong> with hidden areas, collectible gear, and side quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-world math and data skills</strong> seamlessly integrated into gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements, upgrades, and unlockable story paths</strong> that reward exploration and problem-solving</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Virtual reality components (coming soon!)</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "Battle enemies, solve epic puzzles, and explore dangerous worlds—your greatest weapon is your mind. Outsmart foes and level up in this action-packed adventure where strategy meets stats.",
